0,1,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
1,1,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a fair way to allocate these spaces. I suggest we look at the actual usage and the physical layout first.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We should also consider the financial implications for the building and the residents.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,It is important to know if the current distribution is actually biased or if it is just a perception.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not create a system that ruins the atmosphere here. I want to see how other buildings handled this.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm worried about who has to do the work to manage it! I want to know how much effort it takes.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, if you want to check the distribution, the minutes or the register might help.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, checking the treasurer's files might answer your question about the workload.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will look into the history of the allocations.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll check the neighboring block's experience.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"That sounds good, Ryuji! I'll do that.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll focus on the morning congestion and the condition of the spaces.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the building ledger and the external parking costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I'll also look at the sticker register to see who is actually riding.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll check the complaint logs to see the nature of the friction.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll also look at the display frame trial to see if new racks are hard to use.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
