55,3,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
56,3,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
57,3,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
58,3,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
59,3,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"The options are Paid Allocation, Shared Racks, or an Annual Lottery. Given the rain and congestion, Shared Racks seem chaotic.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Paid Allocation would provide funds, but as Shunichi noted, it might create social friction.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,"An Annual Lottery solves the ""same people"" problem and is completely fair.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,I strongly support the Lottery. It prevents the arrears and avoidance seen in the neighboring block.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mio,,The Lottery sounds the easiest to manage. No monthly billing and no heavy lifting with racks.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, would a lottery solve the rain exposure issue? Yes, because everyone takes a turn with the bad spots.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, if we don't choose Paid Allocation, we still have no money for better racks. But the lottery is stable.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,Exactly. It's a clean break from the past five years of stagnation.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,It's the most rational choice to maintain harmony.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mio,,I'm all for it!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. The lottery is the most logical way to distribute the ""burden"" of the rain-exposed spots.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I can accept the lottery. It avoids the financial conflict while ensuring rotation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,It seems we are in agreement.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'm satisfied with this.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mio,,Me too!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
